  book_title: Unofficial Histories of Southwest
  book_color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  book_clue_index: 115
  content: A collection of folk legends and strange customs from southwest.
  clue_content: "Somewhere in the southwest lies a village hidden from the world
    for generations. Few can find it\u2014and those who do can never leave! Its inhabitants
    secretly cultivate an unnatural creature: a flower by day, an insect by night.
    With it, they can control a person\u2019s limbs, slowly stripping away their
    will."
